{
  "$description": "SEG design tokens: the single source for brand colours, type, spacing and radii. Read by scripts/lib/brand-tokens.js (design generators) and exported to seg-tokens.css / tailwind.seg.cjs for the platform UI (Next.js, RTL). Blue ramp: the SEG logo's own blues (darkest / mid / lightest measured from the CEO's file, 6 Nov 2026) plus interpolated steps. Navy and cyan: the colours already used on every campaign design. Status: proposal until the CEO approves the identity.",
